gh  membership you can sign up at david  pakman.com slash membership membership  comes with some great member benefits  you can use the coupon code  I voted 17 to get a 40% discount  you can become a patron at patreon.com  slash david pakman show this is great  for quick small donations if you don't  want to create an account on our website  and just want to throw a dollar or two a  month our way and number three if you  ever shop on amazon.com you can go to  david pakman.com slash amazon membership  has been a really really great thing  many people signing up for membership in  response to what has been going on and  membership gets you the commercial-free  all-access pass as well as instant  access to the bonus show also patreon  very very simple and we have crested the  1600 patron mark as of yesterday and  that has been a big big help so I want  to be super clear the shows not ending  tomorrow but if we want to continue  doing everything we've been doing and  everything we want to continue doing and  I think that there's no more important  time to be doing that we do need to make  up the lost revenue and I think that  that we've presented a variety of  options for people to support us if they  can and you know what if you genuinely  can't afford $1 a month I don't want you  to contribute because I still want to be  doing the show for you and it should be  accessible for free but if you can  contribute as little as a dollar a month  this is the time to do it so the  situation seems less like the panic  David that we would see if there was a  tornado coming but with the raindrops  drip drip dripping maybe there's a flood  ensuing and you're concerned David I'm  liking this water analogy I'm liking the  water analogy to the extent that I  understand it and that is a you know  roughly a 20 30 % understanding right  now but we'll talk about that later in  any case people I want to tell you Pat  and I want to tell everybody else who's  watching the show is not ending 